# Lumberjack gathering with self recovery, independent Tracking setup and one automatic Recall attempt.
# Needs: One Hatchet, bandages, reagents, recovery and harvest hotkeys. Automatic Recall needs a charged book with a Home rune.
# Tracking reuses a confirmed, active hunt color. Setup is independent of auto_recall.
# Housekeeping converts all wood colors to Boards and packs them in the loadout looting pouch every 2 minutes.
# For Tracking-triggered Recall, set Hunt Frequency to Always Get Closest in the Tracking window.
# Design and in-game checks: blueprint/lumberjack-pvp-handbook.html part 8.
# Optional cooldown bars: heal pot, walk, reflect. A missing walk or reflect bar cannot
# protect a cast from movement or reject an early Reflect retry. Check the active character.
# Warmode and an existing cursor belong to the player. Gathering and self buffs stand down.
# No attack, TK, summons, Meditation or automatic PvP-script switch belongs to this loop.
# A Recall decision stops gathering until this script is restarted. Sending Recall is not arrival.
# This script casts RecallCharge to Home. It does not walk to or enter a moongate.
# Server-event overheads and manual Tracking displays stay in the profile.
# The server blocks harvest for 60 seconds after Recall, Moongate, Hike, Teleport or Rope.
# The profile displays recent-travel refusals. The script does not read that message or restart the delay.
# The harvest retry only spaces attempts. It cannot shorten the server travel restriction.
# Hotkeys: Drink Cure, > Smart Heal/Cure Self, Drink Heal, > Greater Heal/Cure Self,
#          Cancel Current Target, Bandage Self, Drink Refresh, Use item in hand, > Interrupt.
# Generated from recipe/lumberjack-enhanced.recipe by util/build-scripts.py. Edit module/ and recipe/, not this file.

clearall
clearsysmsg
cleardragdrop
clearignore

if pvp
    overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 254
    stop
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # CONFIG
# ####################################################################################
# Optional script overheads. Essential warnings remain visible.
@setvar! config__chatty 1
# Journal diagnostics. Each block that writes one says so in its own comments.
@setvar! config__sysmsg 1

# Independent features. No option overrides another.
@setvar! config__use_magery 1
@setvar! config__use_potions 1
@setvar! config__use_bandages 1
# 1 makes our own casts wait while the walk bar runs, so a step does not break them.
# 0 casts while walking, for a fight where there is no better moment to wait for.
@setvar! config__walk_guard 1
# 1 when warmode is the player's manual control window: our own casts stand down while it is on.
@setvar! config__warmode_is_manual 1

# Minimum current mana for the Cure agent.
@setvar! config__mana_cure 6

# Missing hit points, not percent.
#   heal_hits       heal potion
#   emergency_hits  Greater Heal when no heal potion can go out. Not below heal_hits
@setvar! config__heal_hits 35
@setvar! config__emergency_hits 45
# Minimum current mana for Greater Heal. It keeps no reserve: raise it to 31 to always leave
# 20 mana for an attack or Teleport.
@setvar! config__mana_greater_heal 11

# Healing must be above this to bandage. 0 means any Healing at all.
@setvar! config__heal_skill_min 0

# Light Heal beside the bandages. With no bandage able to run (use_bandages 0, no Healing, or
# none left) it goes anyway, as the bandage stand-in. Needs use_magery.
@setvar! config__use_light_heal 0
# Missing hit points that start the light Heal, and its minimum current mana.
@setvar! config__light_hits 15
@setvar! config__mana_heal 4

# Current stamina at or below this drinks a Refresh.
@setvar! config__refresh_stam 15

# Reuse an active, confirmed hunt color. Otherwise check the window and set the color before the loop.
@setvar! config__use_tracking 1
# Tracking color: 1 red (murderer), 2 grey (criminal), 3 orange (enemy), 4 all three.
# Grey here means Criminal Players. The profile displays server Tracking messages.
@setvar! config__tracking_color 1
@setvar! config__show_tracking 0

# Automatic Recall only. 0 skips its detection reads, book checks and weight decisions.
# use_tracking controls startup setup. The profile displays any server Tracking messages.
@setvar! config__auto_recall 1

# Recall on a Tracking report within 1 through 45 steps. Requires auto_recall and use_tracking.
@setvar! config__recall_on_detection 1

@setvar! config__recall_at_any_distance 0
@setvar! config__recall_on_weight 1
@setvar! config__weight_remaining 10
# When automatic Recall is on, pause harvest if no Recall book is available.
@setvar! config__require_runebook 1
# Minimum mana to send RecallCharge.
@setvar! config__mana_recall 11

@setvar! config__use_reactive_armor 1
@setvar! config__use_magic_reflect 1
# Minimum current mana to start each buff.
@setvar! config__mana_reactive_armor 24
@setvar! config__mana_magic_reflect 34
# Missing hit points at which buffs are not started, and cut mid cast.
@setvar! config__buff_max_loss 15
# 0 keeps buffs back while poisoned and cuts one that is casting.
@setvar! config__buff_when_poisoned 0

# Convert Logs and pack Boards together. Reuse the looting pouch selected by loadout.
@setvar! config__pack_lumber 1

# ####################################################################################
# # WAIT AND COOLDOWN
# ####################################################################################
@setvar! wait__poll 100
@setvar! wait__short 200

# Debounce for repeated warnings. Without it an empty potion bag shouts every pass.
@setvar! cooldown__message 3000

@setvar! cooldown__housekeeping 5000

@setvar! wait__target 1000

# Reagent read interval. Five lookups each time. A refill counts within this, and running out
# is caught at once by the refusal line.
@setvar! cooldown__reagents 30000

# Wait for the hand tool cursor in the same block before any other automatic action.
@setvar! wait__harvest_target 3000
# Let the equip request settle before the next hand verification.
@setvar! wait__equip 1000
# Normal tool retry. Resource exhaustion uses the shorter interval below.
@setvar! cooldown__harvest_retry 4000
@setvar! cooldown__harvest_out_retry 2000

# Allow inventory updates after conversion, opening the pouch and drag/drop.
@setvar! wait__lumber_item 500
# Per-phase request budget: Logs and Boards each yield after 2.5 seconds, between item requests.
@setvar! wait__lumber_batch 2500
@setvar! cooldown__food 60000
# 120000 = 2 minutes. Use 180000 for 3 minutes.
@setvar! cooldown__pack_lumber 120000

# ####################################################################################
# # TIMER
# ####################################################################################
if not timerexists "timer__message"
    createtimer "timer__message"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__housekeeping"
    createtimer "timer__housekeeping"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__reagents"
    createtimer "timer__reagents"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__harvest"
    createtimer "timer__harvest"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__food"
    createtimer "timer__food"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__pack_lumber"
    createtimer "timer__pack_lumber"
endif

settimer "timer__message" cooldown__message
settimer "timer__housekeeping" cooldown__housekeeping
# Ready on the first pass, so reagents are read before the first cast.
settimer "timer__reagents" cooldown__reagents
settimer "timer__harvest" cooldown__harvest_retry
settimer "timer__food" cooldown__food
settimer "timer__pack_lumber" 0

# ####################################################################################
# # STATE
# ####################################################################################
# 1 when housekeeping is due this pass. Recall uses this clock before harvesting.
# Inventory maintenance runs last, after Tracking detection.
@setvar! var__housekeeping_pass 0

# Scratch: 1 once a heal potion went out on this pass. HEAL only.
@setvar! var__heal_potion_out 0

# Scratch: 1 when the light Heal goes on this pass. LIGHT HEAL only.
@setvar! var__light_heal_due 0

# Last color confirmed in this client session. Survives Stop and Play only while Hunting stays active.
# If the filter was changed manually, turn Hunting off before Play so it is checked again.
if not varexist var__tracking_setup_color
    @setvar! var__tracking_setup_color 0
endif

# 1 when this run reused a confirmed color or verified it during startup.
@setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 0
# 1 if Hunting was active at startup or the last housekeeping check. No repeated gump setup.
@setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 0
# Temporary button-response flag. Wait for each response before cycling the next filter.
@setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 0

# Recall decision: 0 keep gathering, 1 stop optional work and attempt Recall when input is free.
# Detection or low spare weight sets this to 1. Only restarting the script resets it.
@setvar! var__recall_needed 0

# 0 waits to send RecallCharge, 1 means its command was sent. Recovery continues in either state.
# Keep 1 even after refusal so the running loop cannot repeat Recall. Restart for another attempt.
# This flag records the request, not arrival. No response timer or timed notice is needed.
@setvar! var__recall_sent 0

# Own-book presence, refreshed on housekeeping passes before automatic Recall is sent.
# Initial 0 keeps book-required gathering paused until the first inventory check.
@setvar! var__recall_book_available 0

# Reagent flags, written only by REAGENTS. 1 when every reagent of that spell was found.
#   Cure            garlic 3972, ginseng 3973
#   Heal            garlic, ginseng, silk 3981
#   Greater Heal    garlic, ginseng, silk, mandrake 3974
#   Reactive Armor  garlic, silk, ash 3980
#   Reflection      garlic, silk, mandrake
@setvar! var__regs_cure 0
@setvar! var__regs_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
@setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 0
@setvar! var__has_garlic 0
@setvar! var__has_ginseng 0
@setvar! var__has_mandrake 0
@setvar! var__has_ash 0
@setvar! var__has_silk 0

# Delay for the next tool attempt, in ms. Resource exhaustion selects the shorter retry.
# Each attempt restores the normal interval. Reuse timer__harvest without another timer.
@setvar! var__harvest_retry cooldown__harvest_retry

# Selected Hatchet serial, reused across Stop and Play in this client session.
# 0 means no tool selected yet. Backpack discovery is used only when this cached tool is missing.
if not varexist var__my_hatchet
    @setvar! var__my_hatchet 0
endif

# 1 while another block holds our buff casts back. Nothing sets it unless the loop has such a block.
@setvar! var__hold_casts 0

# Scratch graphic for the two lumber passes: 7133 Logs, then 7127 Boards. No persistent batch stage.
@setvar! var__lumber_graphic 0

if config__pack_lumber = 1
    if not varexist global__my_looting_pouch or not find global__my_looting_pouch backpack
        overhead "[ loot pouch, pick ]" 255
        setvar global__my_looting_pouch
    endif
endif

# loot/recycle runs the hotkey named in this list when it finishes or gives up. A list, because
# a variable cannot hold a word (blueprint/razor.html part 3). It lasts until the client closes.
if not listexists 'list__resume_script'
    createlist 'list__resume_script'
endif
clearlist 'list__resume_script'
pushlist 'list__resume_script' 'Play Script: gather\lumberjack-enhanced'

if config__sysmsg = 1
    sysmsg "Lumberjack enhanced v17 loaded: auto recall={{config__auto_recall}}, tracking color={{config__tracking_color}}." 88
endif
if config__chatty = 1
    overhead "[ lumberjack, on ]" 290
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # TRACKING SETUP
# ####################################################################################
# Reuse the color verified by this script while Hunting remains active.
# A buff alone does not identify the filter. A first run checks the current window instead.
if config__use_tracking = 1 and skill "Tracking" > 0
    if findbuff "tracking" and var__tracking_setup_color = config__tracking_color
        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
        @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 1
    elseif diffhits < config__heal_hits and not poisoned and not warmode
        if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
            useskill "Tracking"
            waitforgump 4267467659 wait__target

            if gumpexists 4267467659
                # Do not cycle past an already correct filter. The window displays the selected type.
                if config__tracking_color = 1 and ingump "Murderer Players" 4267467659
                    @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                elseif config__tracking_color = 2 and ingump "Criminal Players" 4267467659
                    @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                elseif config__tracking_color = 3 and ingump "Enemy Players" 4267467659
                    @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                elseif config__tracking_color = 4 and ingump "All Hostile Players" 4267467659
                    @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                endif

                if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 0
                    # An active hunt must stop before cycling through animals and other player colors.
                    if findbuff "tracking"
                        gumpresponse 6 4267467659
                        wait wait__short
                        for 60
                            if not findbuff "tracking"
                                break
                            endif
                            wait wait__poll
                        endfor
                    endif

                    # Discard the old target and old filter replies only while setting up.
                    clearsysmsg
                    if not findbuff "tracking" and gumpexists 4267467659
                        # Button 8 cycles ten hunt filters. Bound the attempt to one complete rotation.
                        for 10
                            if diffhits >= config__heal_hits or poisoned or warmode or hidden or queued or casting or targetexists
                                break
                            endif
                            if not gumpexists 4267467659
                                break
                            endif
                            gumpresponse 8 4267467659
                            @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 0
                            # Only one selection is outstanding. Do not outrun a delayed server response.
                            for 60
                                if diffhits >= config__heal_hits or poisoned or warmode or hidden or queued or casting or targetexists
                                    break
                                endif
                                if config__tracking_color = 1
                                    if insysmsg "You will now hunt murderer players"
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                        break
                                    endif
                                elseif config__tracking_color = 2
                                    if insysmsg "You will now hunt criminal players"
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                        break
                                    endif
                                elseif config__tracking_color = 3
                                    if insysmsg "You will now hunt enemy players"
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                        break
                                    endif
                                elseif config__tracking_color = 4
                                    if insysmsg "You will now hunt all hostile players"
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                        @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                        break
                                    endif
                                endif
                                if insysmsg "You will now hunt"
                                    @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                    break
                                endif
                                wait wait__poll
                            endfor
                            if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 1 or var__tracking_button_answered = 0
                                break
                            endif
                        endfor
                    endif
                endif

                if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 1 and gumpexists 4267467659 and diffhits < config__heal_hits and not poisoned and not warmode and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                    # Setup reports belong to the old/intermediate filter, never to Recall detection.
                    clearsysmsg
                    if not findbuff "tracking"
                        gumpresponse 6 4267467659
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                    if findbuff "tracking"
                        @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 1
                        @setvar! var__tracking_setup_color config__tracking_color
                    endif
                    if config__show_tracking = 0
                        gumpclose 4267467659
                    endif
                elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ track, miss ]" 254
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ track, miss ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # MAIN LOOP
# ####################################################################################
while not dead
    # The pvp expression means structured-PvP restrictions, not a field PK encounter.
    if pvp
        overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 254
        stop
    endif

    # Schedule slow checks without running optional inventory work ahead of recovery or harvest.
    @setvar! var__housekeeping_pass 0
    if timer "timer__housekeeping" >= cooldown__housekeeping
        @setvar! var__housekeeping_pass 1
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # PARALYZE
    # ################################################################################
    # Nothing else can act while held, so the pouch goes out at once, as in bard-necro-enhanced.
    if paralyzed
        if findtype 3705 backpack 38
            yell "[Pouch"
            wait wait__short
        elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
            overhead "[ pouch, out ]" 254
            settimer "timer__message" 0
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # CURE
    # ################################################################################
    # Potion first, it is instant and has no cooldown, and it goes out during a cast. While any
    # cure potion is carried the agent is not used, so mana stays for Greater Heal. The agent
    # waits for the walk bar and for warmode as config__walk_guard and config__warmode_is_manual say.
    if poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if config__use_potions = 1 and findtype "Orange Potion" self
            hotkey "Drink Cure"
            wait wait__short
        else
            if config__use_potions = 1 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ cure pot, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif

            if config__use_magery = 1 and var__regs_cure = 1 and mana >= config__mana_cure and not casting
                if config__warmode_is_manual = 0 or not warmode
                    if config__walk_guard = 0 or cooldown "walk" = 0
                        hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
                        if config__sysmsg = 1
                            sysmsg "Agent: Smart Heal/Cure Self for poison." 88
                        endif
                        wait wait__short

                        for 60
                            if not casting
                                break
                            endif
                            if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                                break
                            endif
                            wait wait__poll
                        endfor
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # HEAL
    # ################################################################################
    # Heavy damage drinks first, because the potion is instant and goes out during a cast.
    # Greater Heal follows when no potion went out on this pass and the loss is at the
    # emergency line: none carried, on its own cooldown, or the bar still running.
    # The bar skips the label read while it runs. The label stays authoritative when the bar
    # is missing. Greater Heal waits for the walk bar and for warmode as the switches say.
    if not poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists and diffhits >= config__heal_hits
        @setvar! var__heal_potion_out 0
        if config__use_potions = 1 and cooldown "heal pot" = 0
            if findtype "Yellow Potion" self as alias__heal_potion
                getlabel alias__heal_potion label__heal_potion
                if "next usable" in label__heal_potion
                    # Still on its own cooldown.
                else
                    hotkey "Drink Heal"
                    @setvar! var__heal_potion_out 1
                    wait wait__short
                endif
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ heal pot, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif

        if var__heal_potion_out = 0 and diffhits >= config__emergency_hits and config__use_magery = 1 and var__regs_greater_heal = 1 and mana >= config__mana_greater_heal and not casting
            if config__warmode_is_manual = 0 or not warmode
                if config__walk_guard = 0 or cooldown "walk" = 0
                    hotkey "> Greater Heal/Cure Self"
                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "Agent: Greater Heal/Cure Self." 88
                    endif
                    wait wait__short

                    for 60
                        if not casting
                            break
                        endif
                        if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                            break
                        endif
                        wait wait__poll
                    endfor

                    # The agent leaves its beneficial cursor up when there is nothing left to heal.
                    if targetexists "beneficial" and diffhits = 0
                        hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # BANDAGE
    # ################################################################################
    # Never restarts a running bandage, and full health does not start one. Its target cursor
    # would replace a held precast, so it waits while any cursor is up.
    if config__use_bandages = 1 and not bandaging and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists and skill "Healing" > config__heal_skill_min
        if diffhits > 0 or poisoned
            if findtype 3617 self
                hotkey "Bandage Self"
                wait wait__short
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ bandage, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # LIGHT HEAL
    # ################################################################################
    # The bandage stand-in whenever no bandage can run: bandages off, no Healing, or none left
    # and none running. Beside the bandages only with config__use_light_heal 1. The agent waits
    # for the walk bar and for warmode as the switches say.
    if not poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and config__use_magery = 1 and var__regs_heal = 1 and diffhits >= config__light_hits and mana >= config__mana_heal
        @setvar! var__light_heal_due 0
        if config__use_light_heal = 1 or config__use_bandages = 0 or skill "Healing" <= config__heal_skill_min
            @setvar! var__light_heal_due 1
        elseif not bandaging and not findtype 3617 self
            @setvar! var__light_heal_due 1
        endif

        if var__light_heal_due = 1
            if config__warmode_is_manual = 0 or not warmode
                if config__walk_guard = 0 or cooldown "walk" = 0
                    hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "Agent: Smart Heal/Cure Self, light Heal." 88
                    endif
                    wait wait__short

                    for 60
                        if not casting
                            break
                        endif
                        if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                            break
                        endif
                        wait wait__poll
                    endfor

                    if targetexists "beneficial" and diffhits = 0
                        hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # REFRESH
    # ################################################################################
    if stam <= config__refresh_stam and config__use_potions = 1 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if findtype "Red Potion" self
            hotkey "Drink Refresh"
            wait wait__short
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # AUTO RECALL
    # ####################################################################################
    # This entire path is skipped when automatic Recall is disabled.
    if config__auto_recall = 1
        if var__recall_sent = 0
            # Reuse housekeeping passes for slow checks. No separate Recall scan timer.
            if var__housekeeping_pass = 1
                if var__recall_needed = 0 and config__recall_on_detection = 1 and config__use_tracking = 1
                    @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 0
                    if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 1 and findbuff "tracking"
                        @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 1
                    endif

                    if var__tracking_hunting_active = 0 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                        overhead "[ track, check ]" 255
                        settimer "timer__message" 0
                    endif
                endif

                @setvar! var__recall_book_available 0
                if findtype "runebook" backpack or findtype "runetome" backpack
                    @setvar! var__recall_book_available 1
                elseif config__require_runebook = 1 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ runebook, out ]" 254
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            endif

            # Read Tracking before harvesting and inventory maintenance. Profile overheads display it.
            if config__recall_on_detection = 1 and config__use_tracking = 1
                if var__tracking_hunting_active = 1 and var__recall_needed = 0
                    if config__recall_at_any_distance = 1
                        if insysmsg "Now tracking:" or insysmsg "Distance to destination:" or insysmsg "spaces to target"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        endif
                    else
                        # Keep all 45 literal distance branches. No player find is needed.
                        if insysmsg "Distance to destination: 45 steps" or insysmsg "(45 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 44 steps" or insysmsg "(44 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 43 steps" or insysmsg "(43 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 42 steps" or insysmsg "(42 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 41 steps" or insysmsg "(41 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 40 steps" or insysmsg "(40 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 39 steps" or insysmsg "(39 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 38 steps" or insysmsg "(38 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 37 steps" or insysmsg "(37 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 36 steps" or insysmsg "(36 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 35 steps" or insysmsg "(35 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 34 steps" or insysmsg "(34 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 33 steps" or insysmsg "(33 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 32 steps" or insysmsg "(32 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 31 steps" or insysmsg "(31 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 30 steps" or insysmsg "(30 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 29 steps" or insysmsg "(29 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 28 steps" or insysmsg "(28 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 27 steps" or insysmsg "(27 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 26 steps" or insysmsg "(26 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 25 steps" or insysmsg "(25 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 24 steps" or insysmsg "(24 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 23 steps" or insysmsg "(23 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 22 steps" or insysmsg "(22 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 21 steps" or insysmsg "(21 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 20 steps" or insysmsg "(20 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 19 steps" or insysmsg "(19 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 18 steps" or insysmsg "(18 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 17 steps" or insysmsg "(17 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 16 steps" or insysmsg "(16 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 15 steps" or insysmsg "(15 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 14 steps" or insysmsg "(14 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 13 steps" or insysmsg "(13 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 12 steps" or insysmsg "(12 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 11 steps" or insysmsg "(11 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 10 steps" or insysmsg "(10 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 9 steps" or insysmsg "(9 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 8 steps" or insysmsg "(8 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 7 steps" or insysmsg "(7 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 6 steps" or insysmsg "(6 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 5 steps" or insysmsg "(5 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 4 steps" or insysmsg "(4 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 3 steps" or insysmsg "(3 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 2 steps" or insysmsg "(2 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        elseif insysmsg "Distance to destination: 1 steps" or insysmsg "(1 spaces to target)"
                            @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        endif
                    endif
                    if var__recall_needed = 1 and config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "Recall trigger: Tracking report, configured color={{config__tracking_color}}." 88
                    endif
                endif
            endif

            # Weight shares housekeeping cadence too. Detection is always read first.
            if var__housekeeping_pass = 1
                if config__recall_on_weight = 1 and var__recall_needed = 0
                    if diffweight <= config__weight_remaining
                        @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                        if config__sysmsg = 1
                            sysmsg "Recall trigger: spare weight at or below {{config__weight_remaining}}." 88
                        endif
                        if timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                            overhead "[ weight, low ]" 254
                            settimer "timer__message" 0
                        endif
                    endif
                endif
            endif

            # Keep gathering paused while waiting for mana, a book or free input.
            if var__recall_needed = 1
                # Heat of Battle is not a local gate. Let the server accept or refuse the request.
                # Recall uses no combat preparation or Strength and Agility potions.
                if mana >= config__mana_recall and not paralyzed and not warmode
                    if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and cooldown "walk" = 0
                        if var__recall_book_available = 1
                            if findtype "runebook" backpack or findtype "runetome" backpack
                                # Change Home to your rune name. This requests Recall, not Gate Travel.
                                say "[RecallCharge Home"
                                @setvar! var__recall_sent 1

                                if config__chatty = 1
                                    overhead "[ recall, on ]" 290
                                endif

                                wait wait__short
                            else
                                # A removed book invalidates the cache. Wait for housekeeping to search again.
                                @setvar! var__recall_book_available 0
                            endif
                        endif

                        if var__recall_book_available = 0 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                            overhead "[ runebook, out ]" 254
                            settimer "timer__message" 0
                        endif
                    endif
                elseif mana < config__mana_recall and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ mana, low ]" 254
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            endif
        else
            # One request per Play. Recovery keeps running, but harvest and repeat Recall stay paused.
            # Only an actual refusal gets a result notice. Silence or elapsed time does not prove arrival.
            if insysmsg "Magical travel is not allowed in this location." or insysmsg "Magical travel from inside a dungeon is only possible near golden moongates." or insysmsg "You do not have access to travel inside this house."
                overhead "[ recall, blocked ]" 254
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # A latched Recall keeps the cast window: the self buffs stand down until the script restarts.
    if var__recall_needed = 1
        @setvar! var__hold_casts 1
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # REAGENTS
    # ################################################################################
    # First in the pass, so every cast block below reads fresh flags. On the interval, or at once
    # after a refusal for reagents, so a stale flag cannot send the same doomed cast every pass.
    if config__use_magery = 1
        if timer "timer__reagents" >= cooldown__reagents or insysmsg "More reagents are needed"
            settimer "timer__reagents" 0

            @setvar! var__has_garlic 0
            @setvar! var__has_ginseng 0
            @setvar! var__has_mandrake 0
            @setvar! var__has_ash 0
            @setvar! var__has_silk 0

            if findtype 3972 self
                @setvar! var__has_garlic 1
            endif
            if findtype 3973 self
                @setvar! var__has_ginseng 1
            endif
            if findtype 3974 self
                @setvar! var__has_mandrake 1
            endif
            if findtype 3980 self
                @setvar! var__has_ash 1
            endif
            if findtype 3981 self
                @setvar! var__has_silk 1
            endif

            @setvar! var__regs_cure 0
            @setvar! var__regs_heal 0
            @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
            @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
            @setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 0

            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_cure 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_silk = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_heal 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_ash = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 1
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # SMART HARVEST
    # ####################################################################################
    # Tracking/Recall reads take priority over this lower-priority result message.
    # The profile displays harvest,out. Start the next retry from this response, without blocking recovery.
    if insysmsg "You do not see any harvestable resources nearby"
        @setvar! var__harvest_retry cooldown__harvest_out_retry
        settimer "timer__harvest" 0
    endif

    # Equip independently of book, Hunting and weight readiness. Only a Recall decision pauses both.
    if var__recall_needed = 0 and diffhits < config__heal_hits and not poisoned and not paralyzed and not warmode and timer "timer__harvest" >= var__harvest_retry
        if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and cooldown "walk" = 0
            settimer "timer__harvest" 0
            @setvar! var__harvest_retry cooldown__harvest_retry

            # Follow bard-mace: an empty left hand needs equipment, regardless of type-search results.
            if lhandempty
                if not find var__my_hatchet backpack
                    @setvar! var__my_hatchet 0
                    if findtype 3907|3908 backpack as alias__packed_hatchet
                        @setvar! var__my_hatchet alias__packed_hatchet
                    endif
                endif

                if find var__my_hatchet backpack as alias__hatchet_to_equip
                    # lift waits for the held item. Do not infer equipped state from this request.
                    lift alias__hatchet_to_equip
                    drop self lefthand
                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "Hatchet equip requested: stored serial={{var__my_hatchet}}. Next attempt checks lefthand." 88
                    endif
                    wait wait__equip
                elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ hatchet, out ]" 254
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            elseif findlayer self lefthand as alias__equipped_hatchet
                # Adopt an already held Hatchet once, including replacement tools with a new serial.
                if var__my_hatchet != alias__equipped_hatchet
                    getlabel alias__equipped_hatchet label__hand_tool
                    if "hatchet" in label__hand_tool or "Hatchet" in label__hand_tool
                        @setvar! var__my_hatchet alias__equipped_hatchet
                    elseif not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and not warmode
                        # Clear only a different left-hand tool. The next attempt equips our Hatchet.
                        lift alias__equipped_hatchet
                        drop backpack
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                endif

                # A slot-to-serial match proves this selected tool is actually in lefthand.
                # One guard chain preserves book/Hunting bypasses without mixing and/or.
                # Recheck input after tool discovery. Do not add a separate ready state.
                if var__my_hatchet != alias__equipped_hatchet or diffweight <= 0 or hidden or queued or casting or targetexists or warmode
                    # The hand, spare weight or player input is not ready for harvesting.
                elseif config__auto_recall != 0 and config__require_runebook != 0 and var__recall_book_available != 1
                    # Automatic Recall requires a carried book only when require_runebook is on.
                elseif config__auto_recall != 0 and config__recall_on_detection != 0 and config__use_tracking != 0 and var__tracking_hunting_active != 1
                    # Hunting is required only when all three detection switches are on.
                else
                    hotkey "Use item in hand"
                    waitfortarget wait__harvest_target

                    # The tool queue can still be pending. A neutral cursor is ready to answer.
                    if targetexists "neutral" and not hidden and not casting and not warmode
                        target self
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                    settimer "timer__harvest" 0
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ################################################################################
    # # SELF BUFFS
    # ################################################################################
    # Reactive Armor, then Magic Reflection, whenever one is missing and the window is free.
    # Not started at config__buff_max_loss, and cut there mid cast so the next pass can heal.
    # With config__buff_when_poisoned 0 poison holds them back and cuts them too, so the cure
    # goes first. var__hold_casts lets another block keep the cast window (a latched Recall).
    # The walk and warmode switches apply as for the heal agents. The reflect bar is the
    # server's recast lock after Reflect is used up.
    if config__use_magery = 1 and var__hold_casts = 0 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and diffhits < config__buff_max_loss
        if config__buff_when_poisoned = 1 or not poisoned
            if config__warmode_is_manual = 0 or not warmode
                if config__walk_guard = 0 or cooldown "walk" = 0
                    if config__use_reactive_armor = 1 and var__regs_reactive_armor = 1 and mana >= config__mana_reactive_armor and not findbuff "Reactive Armor"
                        cast "Reactive Armor"
                        if config__sysmsg = 1
                            sysmsg "Buff: Reactive Armor." 88
                        endif
                        wait wait__short

                        for 60
                            if not casting
                                break
                            endif
                            if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                                break
                            endif
                            if diffhits >= config__buff_max_loss
                                hotkey "> Interrupt"
                                break
                            endif
                            if config__buff_when_poisoned = 0 and poisoned
                                hotkey "> Interrupt"
                                break
                            endif
                            wait wait__poll
                        endfor
                    elseif config__use_magic_reflect = 1 and var__regs_magic_reflect = 1 and mana >= config__mana_magic_reflect and cooldown "reflect" = 0 and not findbuff "Magic Reflection"
                        cast "Magic Reflection"
                        if config__sysmsg = 1
                            sysmsg "Buff: Magic Reflection." 88
                        endif
                        wait wait__short

                        for 60
                            if not casting
                                break
                            endif
                            if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                                break
                            endif
                            if diffhits >= config__buff_max_loss
                                hotkey "> Interrupt"
                                break
                            endif
                            if config__buff_when_poisoned = 0 and poisoned
                                hotkey "> Interrupt"
                                break
                            endif
                            wait wait__poll
                        endfor
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # HOUSEKEEPING
    # ####################################################################################
    # Slow inventory reads share the housekeeping clock. Food and lumber skip optional work once a
    # Recall decision is latched.
    if var__housekeeping_pass = 1
        settimer "timer__housekeeping" 0

        # FOOD: skip optional work once a Recall decision is latched.
        if var__recall_needed = 0 and diffhits < config__light_hits
            if timer "timer__food" >= cooldown__food
                if not poisoned and not warmode and not findbuff "Food Satisfaction"
                    if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                        settimer "timer__food" 0
                        if findtype tray backpack as alias__food
                            dclick alias__food
                            wait wait__short
                        endif
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif

        # LUMBER: try each selected stack once, with no snapshots or foreach iterator.
        # Bound scans by the existing timer. A failed conversion/drop waits for the next interval.
        if config__pack_lumber = 1 and var__recall_needed = 0 and timer "timer__pack_lumber" >= cooldown__pack_lumber
            if diffhits < config__light_hits and not poisoned and not paralyzed and not warmode
                if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                    settimer "timer__pack_lumber" 0
                    if find global__my_looting_pouch backpack
                        if config__sysmsg = 1
                            sysmsg "Lumber pack BEGIN: convert Logs, then move Boards." 88
                        endif
                        dclick global__my_looting_pouch
                        wait wait__lumber_item

                        # Two phases share one body: Logs first, then current Boards.
                        # Both scans end by their conditions. Each phase has its own time budget.
                        # Do not reuse pre-conversion serials after conversion or stack merging.
                        for 2
                            if index = 0
                                @setvar! var__lumber_graphic 7133
                            else
                                @setvar! var__lumber_graphic 7127
                            endif
                            settimer "timer__pack_lumber" 0
                            @clearignore

                            # End loops by their conditions. No break skips an if scope or resets the outer for.
                            # Settle the pouch/previous-phase queue within this phase's existing budget.
                            while queued and timer "timer__pack_lumber" < wait__lumber_batch and not dead and not pvp and diffhits < config__light_hits and not poisoned and not paralyzed and not warmode and not hidden and not casting and not targetexists
                                wait wait__poll
                            endwhile

                            # No hue filter. Search current inventory after each conversion or move.
                            # The timer advances even when ignore cannot advance a failed/packed stack.
                            while timer "timer__pack_lumber" < wait__lumber_batch and not queued and not dead and not pvp and diffhits < config__light_hits and not poisoned and not paralyzed and not warmode and not hidden and not casting and not targetexists and find global__my_looting_pouch backpack and findtype var__lumber_graphic backpack as alias__lumber_stack
                                if var__lumber_graphic = 7133
                                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                                        sysmsg "Lumber convert: serial={{alias__lumber_stack}}." 88
                                    endif
                                    dclick alias__lumber_stack
                                    wait wait__lumber_item
                                elseif find alias__lumber_stack global__my_looting_pouch
                                    # Recursive backpack searches can return Boards already in the pouch.
                                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                                        sysmsg "Lumber skip: serial={{alias__lumber_stack}}, already in pouch." 88
                                    endif
                                elseif find global__my_looting_pouch backpack
                                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                                        sysmsg "Lumber move request: serial={{alias__lumber_stack}}, pouch={{global__my_looting_pouch}}." 88
                                    endif
                                    # Complete lift/drop together. Do not leave the item held during a wait.
                                    lift alias__lumber_stack 60000
                                    drop global__my_looting_pouch -1 -1
                                    wait wait__lumber_item
                                endif
                                # Check container membership before ignore, which can hide it from find.
                                # Skip this selected serial only for this phase, including failed requests.
                                @ignore alias__lumber_stack

                                # A pending item queue pauses the next search, without leaving its loop scope.
                                while queued and timer "timer__pack_lumber" < wait__lumber_batch and not dead and not pvp and diffhits < config__light_hits and not poisoned and not paralyzed and not warmode and not hidden and not casting and not targetexists
                                    wait wait__poll
                                endwhile
                            endwhile
                            @clearignore
                        endfor
                        if config__sysmsg = 1
                            sysmsg "Lumber pack END: returning to recovery and harvest checks." 88
                            if queued
                                sysmsg "Lumber pack: item queue still active. Harvest waits for queued=0." 88
                            endif
                            if targetexists
                                sysmsg "Lumber pack: target cursor active. Harvest leaves it to the player." 88
                            endif
                        endif
                    elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                        overhead "[ loot pouch, out ]" 254
                        settimer "timer__message" 0
                    endif
                    # The next interval starts after this batch, including a missing-pouch attempt.
                    settimer "timer__pack_lumber" 0
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    wait wait__poll
endwhile
